MODULE: ConsumerBatchesRespondLagSaturates
TARGET: ConsumerBatchesRespond
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: lag-only backoff incorrectly becomes an admission refusal regime
PERTURBS: Sample

--- FIND
    /\ pressure' \in (IF acute THEN {2} ELSE {0, 1})
    /\ batch' = BP!ViewBatch(pressure') /\ phase' = "pull"
--- REPLACE
    /\ pressure' \in (IF acute THEN {2} ELSE {0, 2})
    /\ batch' = BP!ViewBatch(pressure') /\ phase' = "pull"
    \* MUTATION: lag alone saturates rather than throttles.
--- END
